WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
Local assistants are useful for learning
individual tasks, but context

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:08.080
and checks can remain fragmented.
Shared assurance services

00:00:08.176 --> 00:00:11.600
make expectations and evidence
portable across teams.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.400
Bounded agents can perform more steps,
with greater recovery obligations.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:19.760
The recommended strategic
center is shared assurance.

00:00:19.849 --> 00:00:23.521
Standardize the proof and ownership
before expanding delegated authority.

00:00:23.696 --> 00:00:27.040
That approach preserves the value
of local experimentation

00:00:27.107 --> 00:00:30.080
while building a capability
the institution can operate.
